@startuml govinfo_billstatus
title govinfo_billstatus: federal bills (GovInfo BILLSTATUS bulk XML)
start
:units = (congress, bill type) for
MOGOV_BILLSTATUS_CONGRESSES x MOGOV_BILLSTATUS_TYPES
(hr, s, hjres, sjres, hconres, sconres, hres, sres);
:this shard keeps the units it owns (stable hash);
note right: each zip is downloaded by exactly one shard
repeat
  :GET govinfo.gov/bulkdata/BILLSTATUS/CONGRESS/TYPE/BILLSTATUS-CONGRESS-TYPE.zip
  (streamed to the cache; newest Congress daily, and the outgoing one until Mar 1; older monthly);
  if (404?) then (yes)
    :log and skip the unit;
  else (zip)
    repeat
      :read one *.xml member (one bill);
      :gzip it unchanged under
      RAW_DIR/govinfo_billstatus_xml/CONGRESS/TYPE/;
      :govinfo_billstatus_files row (path, URL, size, sha256);
      :parse with lxml (mogov.parsers.govinfo_billstatus):
      bill, sponsors, cosponsors, actions,
      recorded votes, laws (Public Law number);
    repeat while (more members?)
  endif
repeat while (more zips?)
:govinfo_billstatus_files, _bills, _sponsors, _cosponsors,
_actions, _recorded_votes, _laws (all states; no Missouri filter);
note right: dbt keeps sponsors with state MO\n(fct_federal_sponsorship)
stop
@enduml
